    {
      "uid": "zhcn:187971aedb7a239188bd72dc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好像她原来就很憧憬东商变革。\n不仅如此，气槽和菱亚马逊――",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe7faa1adad17851ad54c5b7a7e1e40bc94e66f77c92114e8a9d4bd6b0f87449",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
