    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4c08435633959a197364aa4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "被历代『女王赛马娘』这样围着，\n会慌张也是没办法的吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49e242fd0e4e08a8f71605b2cbb8438d3afdaa6bc749bb379172192cd48eca8e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0201/storytimeline_020201091.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0af5f950c62d0593918401ba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "女王赛马娘……具体来说『最优秀古马级女王赛马娘』，\n作为URA荣誉之一，是只颁发给绽放华丽光芒的最强者的称号。",
      "source_fingerprint": "964b6dd7564922ed3c938f57e654fffcb5c30c9690fab86e58c7142e99d38f35",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0201/storytimeline_020201091.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3179562b2d6b2c29a884591f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对于莱茵力量这些奔跑于三后冠路线的孩子来说，\n她们可以说是传奇般伟大的存在――",
      "source_fingerprint": "607efe2fd21f15621d694fba89d4a42f3c416f3579557a21160a28ee3e568ee0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0201/storytimeline_020201091.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a596fac68f1e3230c00ab9c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "圣王光环",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae4906d6dcdeefba22045311d828cb642edc30b721f0d70bdfe2ab3207e98c48",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0201/storytimeline_020201091.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b75958d4da6607663a096d6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过，连那么伟大的前辈们，看到比赛后\n也像这样来送祝贺，莱茵不是做到了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce2394bfa7f2caa52900b0d0d6766224ee3c46bff8558801032b109a18daf831",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0201/storytimeline_020201091.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f46ed952475c0d0775b0e6c1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "圣王光环",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae4906d6dcdeefba22045311d828cb642edc30b721f0d70bdfe2ab3207e98c48",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
