    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f12ad552afbdcdb56fc4385",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "其实，莱茵力量在击败了西沙里奥、勇敢之心、空中救主\n等豪强赛马娘后，开始成为人们心目中的英雄。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1697dd6f9ab69c36bdabfde4c43ae6bc23d9e390dc80859ec9372a1ac54c33b2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
