      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "完了～，迟到了……！　都怪你说『头发没弄好～』\n在那磨磨蹭蹭的，赤骥！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aede765cf5818de22e21b7ba2487754b50542f1bbe53b9356aa66207d2228f84",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
